<title>NETHERLANDS: HBG 1996 net profit NLG 111 mln. [CORRECTED 09:35 GMT]</title>
<headline>HBG 1996 net profit NLG 111 mln. [CORRECTED 09:35 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>RIJSWIJK, Netherlands 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, '96</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	    33.66 vs  32.07</p>
<p>    Net profit			   111    vs 104</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		 13.40 vs  12.80</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		  5.83 vs   5.45</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		     153    vs  130</p>
<p>(Corrects category from &quot;Net from ordinary ops&quot; to &quot;Pre-tax profit&quot;)</p>
<p>    Extraordinary items     charge  10    vs   7 gain</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had expected construction firm Hollandsche Beton Groep NV to report a net profit from ordinary operations of between 106 million and 120 million guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
